# The gstack skills this config never exposes: one name per line, read by
# lib/pack-census.sh (grep -qx), so these comment lines never match.
# A name listed is in no pack and no profile, `max` included. Pruned
# 2026-09-28 (BDR-105); the helpers once housed in lib/gstack-removed.sh
# are gone with the symlink toggling (BDR-117).
# Why each name went:
#   ship             base = origin/HEAD = main on Gitea, skips develop
#   land-and-deploy  `gh pr merge --squash --delete-branch` then deploys
#   setup-deploy     companion of land-and-deploy (Claude never deploys)
#   autoplan         reads ~/.claude/skills/gstack/plan-*/ paths that do
#                    not exist in this install
#   context-save     its pair context-restore is not linked; never used
#   learn            parallel JSONL store outside .claude/memory, unused
#   careful, guard   hooks exit 127 (missing bin path), vacuous; the house
#                    permissions.deny is stricter (BDR-095)
#   design-shotgun   mockups need OPENAI_API_KEY, absent
ship
land-and-deploy
setup-deploy
autoplan
context-save
learn
careful
guard
design-shotgun
